I've just started playing the new version of Hack
and I have discovered an interesting way to go down 
a level without the shopkeeper (assuming you are not civil
enough to pay your debts).

If you still have your dog and are ready to descend, manuever
a little, until you are on the staircase and your dog is between 
you and the shopkeeper.  The @ will never see you again. (unless
the climb the stairs again).

